      Values indicate rows in `true_classes`.
    ids: A `Tensor` of type `int64` and shape `[num_accidental_hits]`.
      Values indicate positions in `sampled_candidates`.
    weights: A `Tensor` of type `float` and shape `[num_accidental_hits]`.
